    # terminal.nuon
    {id: "F5 <digit>", file: "terminal.nuon", digest: "c7e646b9770a39f5", reviewer: "cc-1787301962", date: "2026-08-21", note: "borderline and left standing: `a one-shot key table, not a mode you have to leave` re-says the use's `the mode is over the moment you press the second key`, but `any key pops it, mapped or not` is not in the use and is the part that matters"}
    {id: "F5 <letter>", file: "terminal.nuon", digest: "8dc7d41b0734ec59", reviewer: "cc-1787301962", date: "2026-08-21"}
    {id: "nine tabs", file: "terminal.nuon", digest: "b3db4cf38ed1176a", reviewer: "cc-1787301962", date: "2026-08-21"}
    {id: "Ctrl+Shift+X", file: "terminal.nuon", digest: "1fdc0eba74433b26", reviewer: "cc-1787301962", date: "2026-08-21"}
    {id: "Ctrl+V", file: "terminal.nuon", digest: "0ef88c8a069e13be", reviewer: "cc-1787301962", date: "2026-08-21"}
    {id: "Ctrl+C", file: "terminal.nuon", digest: "8823768355048264", reviewer: "cc-1787432671", author: "cc-1787301962", date: "2026-08-21", note: "re-read by a session that wrote neither field, and this is the pair a second reader caught once already. Stands: the use gives two independent cases, the why gives the one ordered test that produces them — selection read first, key sent only on empty — plus the trade a plain CopyTo loses. Neither sentence is the other in different words"}
    {id: "Ctrl+Shift+D", file: "terminal.nuon", digest: "36384356a8515f8b", reviewer: "cc-1787301962", date: "2026-08-21"}
    {id: "Ctrl+Shift+B", file: "terminal.nuon", digest: "69bbc04b413e3091", reviewer: "cc-1787432671", author: "cc-1787301962", date: "2026-08-21", note: "re-read by a session that wrote neither field. Stands, and it is the cleanest of the four: the use is the gesture and when to reach for it, the why is entirely about the key having looked contested and the wallpaper pipeline being DO NOT PORT. No sentence of one appears in the other, and the rebuild rationale now points at the entry that owns it instead of copying it"}
    {id: "Ctrl+Shift+S", file: "terminal.nuon", digest: "e4ba51141e437bfa", reviewer: "cc-1787301962", date: "2026-08-21"}
    {id: "Ctrl+Shift+T", file: "terminal.nuon", digest: "be71ca7c4a6f7fc9", reviewer: "cc-1787301962", date: "2026-08-21"}

